<title>UK: LME ends mixed, nickel off on Inco talks resuming.</title>
<headline>LME ends mixed, nickel off on Inco talks resuming.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Slinks away from $2,600, and closes down on the day.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Mirrors copper, reverses from $1,600.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Slumps to soft close, Inco resumes talks with union.</p>
<p>ZINC - Ends firm, near 4-3/4 year high. LEAD - Steady.</p>
<p>TIN - Closes slightly higher. ALLOY - Quiet</p>
</text>
